  "verification": "draft",
  "notes": [
    "Identifier formats other than the KRA PIN are not published in a source the pack cites: national ID is a lenient seven-or-eight-digit check and every other scheme is free text.",
    "The names of the 10 October holiday, and the dates one name gives way to the next, come from news reports and have not been checked against the Gazette.",
    "The due days of the NSSF, SHA and NITA returns come from secondary sources and are unconfirmed; NSSF sources disagree.",
    "Idd-ul-Fitr is listed for the years 2024 to 2026 only, the years whose Gazette notice the pack cites; Idd-ul-Azha (Part II of the Schedule) and the general-election and swearing-in days are not modelled.",
    "No sub-county or ward list is bundled: both are free text."
  ],
